# LLMs.txt maintenance

When adding a new public Papermind page, also update `public/llms.txt` if the page is an important product, use-case, resource, or policy page that should be discoverable by LLMs.

- Add a concise Markdown link and accurate one-line description.
- Do not add authenticated, private, transactional, or otherwise non-public routes.
- Keep the document's product summary and workflow accurate when the product changes materially.
